    "text": "<p>Considering the following reaction sequence,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/e6c18995-39ed-47bd-9d02-053222bf064b-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 176px;\" /></p><p>the correct option(s) is(are)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
