      "text": "<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/18d7b9b4-4a50-4466-8035-6f47c6a5b3dc-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 83px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/5a293a6d-e129-49aa-9e96-579f56044756-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 85px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&middot;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math><br />\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>KOH</mi></math>, heat</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
